      "category": "Text",
      "text": "MEMORANDUM TO: HEADS OF ALL AGENCIES -\n\nFROM: John V. Lindsay, Mayor\n\nSUBJECT: Administration of the Budget Appropriations for the Fiscal Year 1971-1972 and Prior Fiscal Years",
