      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        605,
        1327,
        662
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "There is attached hereto Executive Order #40 for the administration of budget appropriations for the 1971-1972 fiscal year.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.2781,
          "min": -1.309
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 31,
          "mean": -0.0019,
          "min": -0.0381
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1768,
        "area_px": 62928,
        "density": 0.0281,
        "chars": 123,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 69.57
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        684,
        1341,
        822
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Department of Purchase shall accept no requisitions encumbering appropriations after June 30, 1971, and for purposes of efficient operation may set such date earlier in that month. The same limitations on expenditures shall apply to all other balances of appropriations for which no contract liability is registered on the books of the Office of the Comptroller.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.261,
          "min": -1.3545
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 72,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.002
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4439,
        "area_px": 152352,
        "density": 0.02914,
        "chars": 366,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 82.45
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        844,
        1355,
        920
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Agencies shall place neither orders chargeable to, nor further encumbrances on, annual requirement or other contracts issued for the fiscal year 1970-1971.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.233,
          "min": -1.5133
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0083,
          "min": -0.3177
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1721,
        "area_px": 83904,
        "density": 0.02051,
        "chars": 155,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 90.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        949,
        1372,
        1061
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In addition, effective immediately, no further vouchers are to be processed for payment to the Office of the Comptroller chargeable to appropriations made for the fiscal year 1969-1970 or prior fiscal years unless a contract liability is registered on the books of the Office of the Comptroller.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2236,
          "min": -1.4316
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0004
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 64,
          "mean": -0.0016,
          "min": -0.0966
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2515,
        "area_px": 123648,
        "density": 0.02034,
        "chars": 295,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 117.3
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        1082,
        1378,
        1241
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Expense Budget for the 1970-1971 fiscal period was financed by estimated state and federal aid. Delay in receipt of state and federal reimbursement requires major temporary borrowing by the Comptroller with the result that the City must bear a greater interest cost to finance current operations. In addition, failure to realize these estimated revenues within the fiscal period places severe financial strains on the budget.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2145,
          "min": -1.4085
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 81,
          "mean": -0.0012,
          "min": -0.0793
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3378,
        "area_px": 175536,
        "density": 0.01924,
        "chars": 429,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 127.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        1267,
        1336,
        1347
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "You are therefore directed to exert all your efforts to obtain these receivables still outstanding for the fiscal period 1970-1971 as quickly as possible covering all activities eligible for such aid.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2012,
          "min": -1.3568
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 43,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0011
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1891,
        "area_px": 88320,
        "density": 0.02141,
        "chars": 200,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 105.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87,
        1371,
        1351,
        1427
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "All agencies which are provided with funds in the expense and capital budgets must comply with the provisions of this memorandum.",
